  "content_text": "Wrapping my head around AI wrappers.\n[努力搞懂 AI 套壳]\nWrap my head around something.\n[理解一个很难的概念、弄懂某件复杂的事]\n\nIn a similar way, the mechanics, orientation, and spirit of the creative process are inseparable in their impact.\n[同样地，创作过程的机制、方向以及精神内涵在对其产生的影响方面是密不可分的。]\nOur design can be strategic or organic.\n[我们的设计可以是具有策略性的，也可以是自然的。]\n\nOver the years one of the biggest discoveries we have made is that a person’s orientation counts.\n[多年来，我们所取得的最大发现之一就是一个人的思维方式至关重要。]\n\nIt is easier to think in concrete terms rather than in the abstract.\n[具体思考比抽象思考要容易得多。]\n\nSlowly the awful truth dawned.\n[可怕的真相渐渐浮出水面。]\n\nI've got an awful lot of work to do.\n\nLet’s leave now then.\n\nThe mayor is visiting our office later.\n\nThe invocation pattern is the last pattern.",
