          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "努力搞懂 AI 套壳",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 2.675,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wrap my head around something.",
          "start_time": 2.675,
          "end_time": 4.85,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "理解一个很难的概念、弄懂某件复杂的事",
          "start_time": 2.675,
          "end_time": 4.85,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a similar way, the mechanics, orientation, and spirit of the creative process are inseparable in their impact.",
          "start_time": 4.85,
          "end_time": 12.524999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "同样地，创作过程的机制、方向以及精神内涵在对其产生的影响方面是密不可分的。",
          "start_time": 4.85,
          "end_time": 12.524999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our design can be strategic or organic.",
          "start_time": 12.524999999999999,
          "end_time": 15.424999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "我们的设计可以是具有策略性的，也可以是自然的。",
          "start_time": 12.524999999999999,
          "end_time": 15.424999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Over the years one of the biggest discoveries we have made is that a person’s orientation counts.",
          "start_time": 15.424999999999999,
          "end_time": 21.65,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "多年来，我们所取得的最大发现之一就是一个人的思维方式至关重要。",
          "start_time": 15.424999999999999,
          "end_time": 21.65,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is easier to think in concrete terms rather than in the abstract.",
          "start_time": 21.65,
          "end_time": 26.2,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "具体思考比抽象思考要容易得多。",
          "start_time": 21.65,
          "end_time": 26.2,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Slowly the awful truth dawned.",
          "start_time": 26.2,
          "end_time": 28.55,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "可怕的真相渐渐浮出水面。",
          "start_time": 26.2,
          "end_time": 28.55,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've got an awful lot of work to do.",
          "start_time": 28.55,
          "end_time": 31.150000000000002,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let’s leave now then.",
          "start_time": 31.150000000000002,
          "end_time": 33.050000000000004,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 38.875,
          "end_time": 38.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
